WEBVTT

00:09.090 --> 00:11.380
<b>They know we're here.
We'll be surrounded soon.</b>

00:13.470 --> 00:15.510
<b>The Imperial Command is ours.
Let's get out of here.</b>

00:17.550 --> 00:19.640
<b>It's not my job to protect you.</b>

00:22.480 --> 00:24.560
<b>So if you want to live, try to keep up.</b>

00:33.990 --> 00:36.700
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

01:56.320 --> 02:00.910
<b>THE ELUSIVE
SAMURAI</b>

02:04.160 --> 02:05.580
<b>When I give the signal,</b>

02:06.080 --> 02:07.330
<b>everyone goes in together.</b>

02:10.580 --> 02:11.590
<b>Damn it.</b>

02:12.840 --> 02:14.550
<b>And take this, too!</b>

02:16.720 --> 02:18.840
<b>I can't see the thieves
in all this smoke and light.</b>

02:18.930 --> 02:20.800
<b>-My eyes!
-Get past the smoke!</b>

02:20.890 --> 02:21.890
<b>Give me that.</b>

02:28.560 --> 02:29.770
<b>I can hear them.</b>

02:31.650 --> 02:32.690
<b>I can hear them.</b>

02:32.770 --> 02:34.230
<b>They used the fire as a distraction,</b>

02:34.320 --> 02:36.110
<b>and they're climbing the wall
on the opposite side.</b>

02:38.530 --> 02:39.530
<b>What…</b>

02:39.610 --> 02:40.700
<b>Damn it.</b>

02:41.280 --> 02:43.700
<b>I'm nowhere near as good with the bow
as Sadamune.</b>

02:43.780 --> 02:45.040
<b>-Let's go!
-Westward!</b>

02:45.120 --> 02:46.700
<b>Where is Sadamune?</b>

02:46.790 --> 02:48.580
<b>The thieves scaled the wall and fled!</b>

02:48.660 --> 02:52.210
<b>Gather your pride as Ogasawara's
retainers and don't let them get away!</b>

02:53.170 --> 02:54.460
<b>That's Genba's signal.</b>

02:55.380 --> 02:57.880
<b>-Time to lure them away.
-Yes.</b>

02:57.970 --> 02:59.930
<b>Over there. They escaped on horseback.</b>

03:00.510 --> 03:02.890
<b><i>I heard the sound</i>
<i>of horses starting to run,</i></b>

03:02.970 --> 03:04.970
<b><i>but there was no sound</i>
<i>of the brats' footsteps</i></b>

03:05.060 --> 03:07.020
<b><i>going from the wall to the horse.</i></b>

03:07.100 --> 03:09.350
<b><i>The horses probably belong to</i>
<i>their allies,</i></b>

03:09.430 --> 03:11.400
<b><i>hidden beforehand as a lure.</i></b>

03:11.480 --> 03:13.730
<b><i>And there was no sound</i>
<i>of anyone walking away.</i></b>

03:14.230 --> 03:16.780
<b><i>If that's the case,</i></b>

03:18.320 --> 03:19.780
<b><i>that means they're very close.</i></b>

03:21.320 --> 03:22.870
<b><i>The brats must be in the forest,</i></b>

03:24.030 --> 03:26.740
<b><i>holding their breaths.</i></b>

03:33.500 --> 03:37.670
<b>Where</b>

03:38.590 --> 03:40.340
<b>are</b>

03:41.130 --> 03:43.140
<b>you?</b>

03:43.220 --> 03:47.010
<b><i>It's Sadamune's suck-up,</i>
<i>Sukefusa Ichikawa.</i></b>

03:47.100 --> 03:49.140
<b><i>The guy's got the ears of a fox.</i>
<i>It isn't fair he's hunting us down</i></b>

03:49.220 --> 03:50.390
<b><i>on this dark of a night.</i></b>

03:50.980 --> 03:53.730
<b><i>My illusions to fool his blind spot</i>
<i>won't help us.</i></b>

03:54.480 --> 03:57.110
<b><i>This is bad. We'll be caught at this rate.</i></b>

03:58.440 --> 04:00.400
<b><i>Should I sell this kid out at this point?</i></b>

04:01.320 --> 04:02.780
<b><i>I messed up.</i></b>

04:02.860 --> 04:05.530
<b><i>I thought it'd be fun to teach this naive,</i>
<i>spoiled brat</i></b>

04:05.620 --> 04:07.490
<b><i>the harsh realities of the world.</i></b>

04:17.130 --> 04:18.170
<b><i>This one…</i></b>

04:19.090 --> 04:20.340
<b><i>I'm leaving behind.</i></b>

04:26.260 --> 04:28.390
<b><i>If it's just me, I can make it.</i></b>

04:29.100 --> 04:32.180
<b>-<i>No!</i>
-<i>No one can hear my stealthy steps!</i></b>

04:32.680 --> 04:33.940
<b><i>In hide-and-seek,</i></b>

04:34.020 --> 04:37.060
<b><i>you'll absolutely be caught</i>
<i>if you move from such a close distance!</i></b>

04:37.560 --> 04:40.690
<b>NANBOKUCHO GAME OF TAG</b>

04:41.780 --> 04:43.450
<b>I found you.</b>

04:43.530 --> 04:45.200
<b>ALL-HEARING DEMON
SUKEFUSA ICHIKAWA</b>

04:49.160 --> 04:51.080
<b>Ugh. Damn it.</b>

04:51.160 --> 04:53.250
<b>I shouldn't have brought this long sword.</b>

04:53.330 --> 04:55.370
<b>It's impossible to maneuver.</b>

05:04.840 --> 05:06.050
<b>Hey.</b>

05:06.130 --> 05:07.300
<b>I'm okay.</b>

05:07.390 --> 05:09.930
<b>The blade hit the tree. It's just a cut.</b>

05:13.230 --> 05:15.850
<b>Why did you save me
when I was going to abandon you?</b>

05:15.940 --> 05:17.730
<b>You could have run away by yourself.</b>

05:18.440 --> 05:20.230
<b>I doubted you earlier.</b>

05:20.820 --> 05:22.610
<b>I can't apologize to you if you're dead.</b>

05:23.530 --> 05:27.240
<b>My mental fortitude is weak,</b>

05:27.870 --> 05:30.200
<b>and I don't have what it takes.</b>

05:30.280 --> 05:31.950
<b>In the future, I may doubt you again.</b>

05:32.040 --> 05:33.620
<b>But I promise,</b>

05:33.700 --> 05:36.290
<b>I will never betray you.</b>

05:36.370 --> 05:37.210
<b>What…</b>

05:37.790 --> 05:40.290
<b>I like escaping with you.</b>

05:41.040 --> 05:42.590
<b>With you and your tricks,</b>

05:42.670 --> 05:46.930
<b>I can escape from strong demons
I could never escape from on my own.</b>

05:47.590 --> 05:51.100
<b>Thinking about it that way,
I can't help but get excited.</b>

05:51.970 --> 05:54.180
<b>Even if you're ever cornered,</b>

05:54.890 --> 05:56.520
<b>or if you ever betray me,</b>

05:57.770 --> 06:00.270
<b>when we run away, we run together!</b>

06:10.740 --> 06:14.700
<b><i>Tokiyuki has been betrayed</i>
<i>by countless people,</i></b>

06:15.870 --> 06:19.210
<b><i>but he has never betrayed anyone.</i></b>

06:20.920 --> 06:24.380
<b><i>At a time when betraying and deserting</i>
<i>one's allies was commonplace,</i></b>

06:24.880 --> 06:27.550
<b><i>Tokiyuki could be said to be</i>
<i>a devoted general.</i></b>

06:30.890 --> 06:33.850
<b>Where are those thieves? Damn it.</b>

06:33.930 --> 06:36.270
<b>I can't see as well in the dark
at this age.</b>

06:42.310 --> 06:43.320
<b>Silly…</b>

06:44.480 --> 06:45.900
<b>I'm here for you.</b>

06:48.360 --> 06:51.070
<b>Oh, it's you, Ichikawa!</b>

06:51.160 --> 06:52.530
<b><i>He's speaking to me casually?</i></b>

06:52.620 --> 06:54.080
<b>With you by my side,</b>

06:54.160 --> 06:57.080
<b>we can kill all the thieves in the dark!</b>

06:57.160 --> 06:59.670
<b><i>I'm older and of a higher rank than him.</i></b>

06:59.750 --> 07:02.040
<b><i>Why is he speaking to me so casually?</i></b>

07:05.420 --> 07:07.670
<b>I've hidden some horses
at the end of these woods.</b>

07:07.760 --> 07:08.760
<b>We're almost there.</b>

07:11.090 --> 07:12.180
<b>Okay, let's go.</b>

07:14.390 --> 07:18.100
<b><i>The bleeding isn't stopping.</i>
<i>He can't keep moving for much longer.</i></b>

07:27.650 --> 07:28.650
<b>What?</b>

07:28.740 --> 07:29.820
<b>A thunderbolt?</b>

07:30.570 --> 07:31.570
<b>He's back.</b>

07:32.610 --> 07:34.830
<b>That's Sadamune's arrow.</b>

07:35.530 --> 07:36.580
<b>Don't be stupid.</b>

07:36.660 --> 07:38.500
<b>The sound of his horse
is about one meter away.</b>

07:39.080 --> 07:41.750
<b>In this pitch darkness,
he shouldn't be able to aim so accurately!</b>

07:44.130 --> 07:46.500
<b><i>We still have some time</i>
<i>until we reach our horses.</i></b>

07:46.590 --> 07:49.340
<b><i>I can't outrun that arrow</i>
<i>with this kid with me.</i></b>

07:54.140 --> 07:55.220
<b><i>This damn brat.</i></b>

07:57.640 --> 08:00.640
<b>Trust my ears and fire, Sadamune.</b>

08:03.310 --> 08:07.190
<b>I've entombed many in darkness
with these hands.</b>

08:07.270 --> 08:09.280
<b>Now, Sadamune.</b>

08:09.360 --> 08:12.320
<b>Shall we start off
by shooting down that wounded brat?</b>

08:12.400 --> 08:13.860
<b>Yes, Ichikawa.</b>

08:13.950 --> 08:16.950
<b>Show my arrow the way
with your perfect hearing.</b>

08:17.620 --> 08:20.370
<b><i>If the obligation was invisible,</i>
<i>I could ignore it.</i></b>

08:20.450 --> 08:22.580
<b><i>But an obligation I can see?</i></b>

08:23.250 --> 08:25.080
<b><i>I have to repay it!</i></b>

08:28.090 --> 08:31.300
<b>Are you two old geezers having fun?</b>

08:32.300 --> 08:35.340
<b>What a pain. But I'll take on both of you.</b>

08:35.890 --> 08:37.680
<b>Hmm? That fox mask.</b>

08:37.760 --> 08:39.600
<b>I've heard of it before.</b>

08:39.680 --> 08:42.680
<b>You're Genba Kazama, that thief's brat.</b>

08:42.770 --> 08:43.770
<b>Kazama?</b>

08:43.850 --> 08:47.270
<b>Yes. His father was disgraced
as a warrior for using unfair tactics,</b>

08:47.360 --> 08:50.690
<b>and so he was exiled from his clan.</b>

08:50.780 --> 08:52.820
<b>Then, he fell to thievery.</b>

08:52.900 --> 08:56.320
<b>Kazama is a branch
of the Suwa clan in Shinano…</b>

08:57.070 --> 09:02.330
<b>You've come under Yorishige's order
to steal the Imperial Command, huh?</b>

09:02.410 --> 09:05.290
<b>Imperial Command?
What are you talking about?</b>

09:05.370 --> 09:10.090
<b>I just thought
I'd make fun of you soldiers.</b>

09:18.680 --> 09:21.350
<b>Birds? I can't tell
where the sounds are coming from!</b>

09:22.430 --> 09:25.140
<b>I don't know about killing,
but morphing I know a thing or two about!</b>

09:25.230 --> 09:28.770
<b>And I won't stand losing
to you boring soldiers.</b>

09:35.780 --> 09:37.280
<b>No!</b>

09:37.360 --> 09:38.700
<b>Oh. Oh, no.</b>

09:39.910 --> 09:42.740
<b>You try to bewilder me
with your excessive movement!</b>

09:44.160 --> 09:45.500
<b>You underestimate me!</b>

09:46.250 --> 09:48.130
<b>You can't dodge me from this distance!</b>

09:52.460 --> 09:53.630
<b>Sadamune.</b>

09:53.710 --> 09:54.630
<b>-What?
-What?</b>

09:55.590 --> 09:56.590
<b>Take this!</b>

09:59.010 --> 10:01.600
<b>He cut my bowstring! That's unfair!</b>

10:01.680 --> 10:03.060
<b>Unfair?</b>

10:07.690 --> 10:11.770
<b>My accomplice loves these tricks.</b>

10:11.860 --> 10:15.030
<b>You can't appreciate them
because you're old,</b>

10:15.110 --> 10:19.240
<b>like the old and dusty documents
in that warehouse.</b>

10:19.780 --> 10:22.870
<b>So I told my accomplice, too…</b>

10:24.750 --> 10:27.080
<b>Paper isn't something to steal.</b>

10:27.790 --> 10:29.790
<b>It's more fun to burn.</b>

10:39.720 --> 10:40.800
<b>Oh?</b>

10:50.400 --> 10:54.360
<b><i>The word "Shinobi" appears in one of</i>
<i>the oldest epics of Japan, the Taiheiki,</i></b>

10:54.440 --> 10:56.990
<b><i>which records the events of this time.</i></b>

10:58.150 --> 11:02.200
<b><i>"Bold and forthright" would begin to</i>
<i>disappear from the warrior's vocabulary.</i></b>

11:02.910 --> 11:08.250
<b><i>Those who can infiltrate like spies with</i>
<i>subversive tactics began to be prized.</i></b>

11:09.670 --> 11:11.210
<b><i>And thus, the ninja was born.</i></b>

11:15.920 --> 11:17.760
<b>He disappeared?</b>

11:18.470 --> 11:21.430
<b>In the split second we were shocked
by the warehouse on fire!</b>

11:21.930 --> 11:25.390
<b>Sadamune. Could the Imperial Command
still be in there?</b>

11:26.310 --> 11:29.350
<b>We'll catch the wounded and make him
confess who the ringleader is!</b>

11:29.430 --> 11:31.690
<b>This sound of hooves.</b>

11:32.190 --> 11:34.570
<b>It's the two decoys running away!</b>

11:41.990 --> 11:44.160
<b>I can't catch up from this distance.</b>

11:44.830 --> 11:50.750
<b>That fox-masked brat tricked us all!</b>

11:52.370 --> 11:54.250
<b>I saw the signal to come,</b>

11:54.330 --> 11:56.300
<b>and look how our lord
is in such bad shape!</b>

11:56.380 --> 12:00.470
<b>Hey, Genba!
Be more careful with the Young Lord!</b>

12:00.550 --> 12:01.930
<b>Yeah, that's right!</b>

12:02.010 --> 12:05.890
<b>No, you guys. It's all thanks to Genba
we're able to outrun those two.</b>

12:06.390 --> 12:07.680
<b>It was fun.</b>

12:08.350 --> 12:10.890
<b>I hope we get to play hide-and-seek again.</b>

12:12.810 --> 12:14.150
<b><i>My Genba.</i></b>

12:14.730 --> 12:19.110
<b><i>If you find a lord you'd like to serve</i>
<i>even without turning a profit,</i></b>

12:20.320 --> 12:21.860
<b><i>you should still take the money.</i></b>

12:22.360 --> 12:24.160
<b><i>Even if you plan on serving</i>
<i>till the next life,</i></b>

12:24.240 --> 12:25.530
<b><i>you should still take the money!</i></b>

12:32.540 --> 12:35.830
<b>Fine. If I can have one province.</b>

12:35.920 --> 12:38.750
<b>I won't let you off the hook
if you don't pay.</b>

12:38.840 --> 12:40.880
<b>If you cannot pay,</b>

12:40.960 --> 12:42.510
<b>I'll track down your children,</b>

12:42.590 --> 12:46.050
<b>your grandchildren,
and all your relatives.</b>

12:47.140 --> 12:52.560
<b>That means you'll play tag
with my children too?</b>

12:55.980 --> 12:57.360
<b>That's not what I'm saying!</b>

12:57.440 --> 13:00.360
<b>I'm saying
you better take back the country!</b>

13:00.440 --> 13:03.360
<b>So you're saying you'll play with us
after we take back the country?</b>

13:03.450 --> 13:05.610
<b>Why are you like this?</b>

13:05.700 --> 13:07.660
<b>Come on, Genba. Stop moving!</b>

13:07.740 --> 13:09.490
<b>We're gonna collide!</b>

13:13.500 --> 13:14.620
<b>Go home!</b>

13:14.710 --> 13:18.590
<b>We won't clear out
if you don't have an Imperial Command.</b>

13:18.670 --> 13:21.630
<b>I bet you brutes are lying
about the Imperial Command</b>

13:21.710 --> 13:23.800
<b>so you can steal our land.</b>

13:23.880 --> 13:26.970
<b>That's right! I won't listen to someone
without an Imperial Command!</b>

13:27.470 --> 13:29.970
<b>If you're mad about it,
show me the Command!</b>

13:34.770 --> 13:38.190
<b>Damn those Suwa citizens.</b>

13:39.020 --> 13:43.280
<b>Fighting back uselessly. But I can get
another Imperial Command in a month!</b>

13:43.360 --> 13:45.820
<b>Your eviction notice is simply extended!</b>

13:45.900 --> 13:47.280
<b>There's bad news, my lord!</b>

13:47.360 --> 13:50.280
<b>We can't take the Suwa land anymore.</b>

13:51.240 --> 13:55.040
<b>What?</b>

13:55.120 --> 13:58.670
<b>KYOTO</b>

13:58.750 --> 14:02.630
<b>I took down the Kamakura shogunate.</b>

14:02.710 --> 14:05.420
<b>I took down about 1,000 important
retainers of the Kamakura shogunate.</b>

14:07.510 --> 14:10.300
<b>I commanded Takauji's rebellion.</b>

14:10.390 --> 14:11.720
<b>It was horrible.</b>

14:11.810 --> 14:14.730
<b>I had to fly back to the past with Buddha
and go on a journey.</b>

14:15.310 --> 14:18.810
<b>The majority are seeking reward, and
lying about their achievements to get it.</b>

14:18.900 --> 14:22.440
<b>It'll take years to determine
who's lying and who's telling the truth!</b>

14:22.520 --> 14:25.440
<b>We'll never get to discuss
our official duty.</b>

14:29.780 --> 14:32.240
<b>-What a pain!
-Sir!</b>

14:32.330 --> 14:34.450
<b>The Emperor said, "What a pain!"</b>

14:34.950 --> 14:36.000
<b>MAINTAIN STATUS QUO</b>

14:36.080 --> 14:38.420
<b>"Territories other than Hojo's
will remain as is.</b>

14:39.080 --> 14:41.710
<b>Suwa's will also remain undisputed."</b>

14:44.090 --> 14:46.050
<b>-This is infuriating!
-Let's be patient.</b>

14:46.130 --> 14:47.800
<b>Our chance will come, you know.</b>

14:47.880 --> 14:50.800
<b>You!</b>

14:51.720 --> 14:52.890
<b><i>He is speaking to me casually?</i></b>

14:53.470 --> 14:56.060
<b>Suwa!</b>

14:57.850 --> 14:58.940
<b>We did it!</b>

14:59.020 --> 15:00.400
<b>We're safe!</b>

15:00.940 --> 15:03.400
<b>Buying time really paid off.</b>

15:03.480 --> 15:07.190
<b>If we had simply handed our territory over
to Ogasawara,</b>

15:07.860 --> 15:09.780
<b>we'd never get it back.</b>

15:10.490 --> 15:13.410
<b>I must thank you for saving our land</b>

15:13.490 --> 15:16.080
<b>and also for securing a new,
dependable retainer.</b>

15:18.000 --> 15:21.250
<b>I feel better knowing Genba's
on our side now.</b>

15:21.750 --> 15:25.210
<b>-Though his personality is vulgar.
-Pour me more, pour me more!</b>

15:28.130 --> 15:29.340
<b>With his tricks,</b>

15:29.420 --> 15:32.140
<b>I could see him sneaking
into Takauji's sleeping quarters</b>

15:32.220 --> 15:34.140
<b>and slicing his head off just like that.</b>

15:36.770 --> 15:41.100
<b>That's impossible.
Takauji cannot be assassinated.</b>

15:42.310 --> 15:44.440
<b>Here is a good opportunity, Lord Tokiyuki.</b>

15:44.520 --> 15:47.190
<b>As I've said before,
you should know your enemy.</b>

15:48.110 --> 15:50.030
<b>Takauji Ashikaga is someone</b>

15:50.740 --> 15:53.570
<b>not even I can estimate.</b>

16:07.710 --> 16:09.380
<b>I see you've finally moved with a few men.</b>

16:09.460 --> 16:10.720
<b>EMPEROR GODAIGO'S SON
PRINCE MORIYOSHI</b>

16:10.800 --> 16:12.510
<b>But this shall be your grave.</b>

16:12.590 --> 16:13.840
<b>Your Highness,</b>

16:14.340 --> 16:18.100
<b>I reverently celebrate
your appointment as shogun.</b>

16:19.020 --> 16:20.140
<b>Your Highness,</b>

16:20.230 --> 16:23.150
<b>why do you have to keep coming
for my life?</b>

16:24.480 --> 16:27.400
<b>You are sure to betray
the Emperor one day.</b>

16:27.480 --> 16:31.150
<b>I will stain my hands
for the sake of my father!</b>

16:33.200 --> 16:35.160
<b>Protect the lord!</b>

16:44.710 --> 16:46.840
<b>The lower-ranked soldiers
don't stand a chance.</b>

16:47.380 --> 16:51.220
<b>Armed peasant thieves, monks,
and even rogue states.</b>

16:51.880 --> 16:54.970
<b>Those that follow him are indeed varied.
His charisma draws people in.</b>

16:55.510 --> 16:57.350
<b>Lord, allow me.</b>

16:57.430 --> 16:59.680
<b>No, the prince is after only me.</b>

17:00.390 --> 17:03.600
<b>If I speak to him one-on-one, I'm sure
we'll dissolve any misunderstandings.</b>

17:04.900 --> 17:06.980
<b>Is that okay, brother?</b>

17:07.060 --> 17:08.320
<b>It's no problem.</b>

17:08.400 --> 17:11.030
<b>It's merely the Imperial shogun
and rogues.</b>

17:12.070 --> 17:13.070
<b>Your Highness!</b>

17:13.150 --> 17:15.280
<b>-It's Takauji!
-Kill him!</b>

17:26.460 --> 17:27.580
<b>Please,</b>

17:28.590 --> 17:29.630
<b>settle down.</b>

17:37.680 --> 17:39.260
<b>Don't be intimidated! Go!</b>

17:39.930 --> 17:41.270
<b>Oops.</b>

17:43.060 --> 17:44.600
<b>There are many of you.</b>

17:45.940 --> 17:47.600
<b><i>Takauji Ashikaga.</i></b>

17:48.650 --> 17:50.440
<b><i>My gut was right.</i></b>

17:51.360 --> 17:54.440
<b><i>You're a monster who shouldn't be</i>
<i>allowed to walk the planes of this life.</i></b>

17:55.860 --> 17:58.530
<b>Oh, wait just a moment, Your Highness.</b>

17:58.620 --> 18:01.240
<b>We'll be alone soon enough.</b>

18:18.180 --> 18:19.390
<b>Right. That's done.</b>

18:22.060 --> 18:24.930
<b>Please trust me, Your Highness.</b>

18:26.230 --> 18:29.020
<b>I am loyal and devoted to the Emperor.</b>

18:31.190 --> 18:33.190
<b><i>I couldn't win</i>
<i>if it were just me against him.</i></b>

18:33.940 --> 18:35.400
<b><i>But I'm not alone.</i></b>

18:36.030 --> 18:39.360
<b><i>If we combine everyone's efforts together,</i>
<i>then one day…</i></b>

18:39.450 --> 18:40.620
<b>What's all this commotion?</b>

18:41.990 --> 18:44.830
<b>His Highness has unsheathed his sword.</b>

18:47.750 --> 18:49.420
<b>You guys. You came just in time.</b>

18:50.000 --> 18:51.710
<b>Hurry, we need reinforcements--</b>

18:51.790 --> 18:52.920
<b>It's Lord Takauji.</b>

18:53.000 --> 18:54.210
<b>It's Lord Takauji!</b>

18:54.300 --> 18:56.380
<b>It's Lord Takauji!</b>

18:56.470 --> 18:58.260
<b>It's actually Lord Takauji!</b>

19:00.300 --> 19:02.140
<b>Are you all right, my lord?</b>

19:02.220 --> 19:03.760
<b>Are you hurt?</b>

19:03.850 --> 19:04.930
<b>It's nothing too bad.</b>

19:05.600 --> 19:06.810
<b>Oh, I'm glad.</b>

19:06.890 --> 19:08.060
<b>Lord Takauji…</b>

19:08.140 --> 19:10.730
<b>I'm worried. Let's examine you
in the government office.</b>

19:12.150 --> 19:15.530
<b>My allies from yesterday…
Why are they over there?</b>

19:19.780 --> 19:20.780
<b>My Emperor.</b>

19:20.860 --> 19:23.620
<b>We cannot let that man in.</b>

19:23.700 --> 19:26.620
<b>Something not human writhes within him.</b>

19:27.200 --> 19:28.330
<b>Emperor!</b>

19:29.960 --> 19:31.250
<b>Emperor!</b>

19:36.300 --> 19:39.300
<b>Emperor!</b>

19:40.630 --> 19:42.180
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:43.760 --> 19:44.970
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:45.470 --> 19:46.560
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:46.640 --> 19:48.060
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:49.100 --> 19:51.100
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:51.190 --> 19:52.310
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:54.060 --> 19:55.440
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:56.110 --> 19:57.530
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:57.610 --> 19:58.650
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

19:59.240 --> 20:00.610
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

20:00.700 --> 20:02.110
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

20:03.490 --> 20:05.200
<b><i>Lord Takauji.</i></b>

20:07.700 --> 20:09.370
<b>That happened in Kyo?</b>

20:09.450 --> 20:12.080
<b>He has military might,</b>

20:12.170 --> 20:14.170
<b>which makes it impossible
to assassinate him.</b>

20:14.250 --> 20:16.630
<b>He's also got an otherworldly charm.
That's Takauji Ashikaga.</b>

20:17.250 --> 20:21.010
<b>The person whose popularity
exceeds the Emperor's own son</b>

20:21.800 --> 20:26.100
<b>is a different beast
from the Takauji Ashikaga you know.</b>

20:27.310 --> 20:28.890
<b>Once again, Lord Tokiyuki,</b>

20:29.890 --> 20:33.270
<b>are you prepared to face an opponent
who stands at the top of this world?</b>

20:39.230 --> 20:40.900
<b>Young Lord!</b>

20:44.620 --> 20:46.950
<b>Help me with Genba!</b>

20:48.490 --> 20:50.500
<b>He's wasted
and touching shrine maidens' butts!</b>

20:50.580 --> 20:52.750
<b>And to top it off,
he's jumping around the room…</b>

20:54.830 --> 20:57.170
<b>-Swish, swish.
-People have drawn their swords</b>

20:57.250 --> 21:01.130
<b>because he's jumping around saying
he's gonna sprinkle pee everywhere!</b>

21:01.220 --> 21:02.470
<b>The story of the people at the top</b>

21:02.550 --> 21:04.380
<b>just turned into a story
about the people at the bottom.</b>

21:04.470 --> 21:06.640
<b>Shall we, my lord?</b>

21:06.720 --> 21:09.720
<b>We have to discipline this rude fox.</b>

21:10.270 --> 21:11.270
<b>Yes.</b>

21:13.640 --> 21:15.020
<b>Mr. Yorishige.</b>

21:15.100 --> 21:16.690
<b>You gave me allies.</b>

21:16.770 --> 21:18.360
<b>You gave me a way to fight.</b>

21:18.440 --> 21:21.280
<b>And you gave me self-confidence.</b>

21:22.110 --> 21:24.910
<b>They may still be small,
but they're all treasures you gave me</b>

21:24.990 --> 21:28.120
<b>that I'm proud of.</b>

21:29.870 --> 21:33.080
<b>No matter how much stronger Takauji is,
I won't give up.</b>

21:33.160 --> 21:36.540
<b>I'll collect more treasures
and try as many times as it takes!</b>

21:39.250 --> 21:40.090
<b>Hey, Genba!</b>

21:40.170 --> 21:42.170
<b><i>Takauji and Tokiyuki.</i></b>

21:43.220 --> 21:46.640
<b><i>An invincible lion,</i>
<i>and a rabbit not even on his radar.</i></b>

21:46.720 --> 21:48.180
<b>There! Get him!</b>

21:48.680 --> 21:50.560
<b>-Oh! Yeah, yeah, that's it!
-Over there!</b>

21:53.930 --> 21:56.020
<b><i>The lion doesn't know yet</i></b>

21:57.100 --> 21:58.650
<b><i>that a day will come</i></b>

21:59.440 --> 22:01.480
<b><i>where he will fear the small rabbit.</i></b>

22:01.980 --> 22:04.950
<b>Fluff fluff, fluff fluff, fluff fluff,
fluff fluff.</b>

23:31.620 --> 23:33.620
<b>Translated by Emily Walton</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.870
<b>EPISODE 7 (YEAR OF 1333)
CHILDREN IN WINTER</b>

23:39.040 --> 23:39.870
<b><i>Let's go!</i></b>
